Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:04.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對　說援軍是奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:07.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…為什麼那個國家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:12.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你其實很喜歡奧布吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:15.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才會生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:17.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不對　才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:20.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認熱反應　1點方向 數量20
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:24.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是MS 機體確認　奧布軍Murasame Astray
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:25.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:38.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舵30　取得Tannhauser的射線軸
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:43.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵艦陽電子炮發射狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:46.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避　右舵20
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:50.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.57,0:00:59.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 哪裡來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:04.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:10.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom…基拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚く散った光が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び覚ます
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみは音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,消えるあの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深く愛する
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣と希望強く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感じるこの記憶が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絡み合う心と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ココロをつないで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,動き出している
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輝く光が照らし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び起こす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,響きあう音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,刻むこの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永久に信じ続けて…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-23　戰火背後
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:49.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tannhauser中彈 FCS當機
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:52.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,加緊滅火 FCS重新啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:54.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,損傷控制班待機
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:16.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,水面迫降 全員準備承受衝擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.57,0:03:23.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:02.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是奧布聯合首長國首相
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:04.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:11.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:15.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍 立刻停止戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:17.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤軍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:28.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布向蘇伊士派兵？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.02,0:04:29.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:33.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,烏納特呢 首長會在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:35.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但沒辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,締結同盟就意味著這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:44.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而認同它的就是卡嘉莉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:46.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到會變成這樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.42,0:04:51.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.99,0:04:53.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:58.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們當時強行把卡嘉莉帶來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:00.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她如果還在奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:03.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定不至於發展成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我認為不會改變
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:13.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不認為那時的卡嘉莉能阻止他們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:27.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在肯定不同了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:36.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的卡嘉莉一定能看到當時無法看到的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但眼下怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.09,0:05:51.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布的力量一旦加入聯合軍陣營
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:55.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,力量平衡上又會發生很多變化吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:57.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:00.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這可能使今後…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:02.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 出擊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:05.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:08.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許有些遲到的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:12.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能的話我想阻止這場戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:18.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布不能參加這種戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:21.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不止奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:24.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管在哪 不管是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:28.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓這種盡是戰爭的世界繼續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.68,0:06:32.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以拜託你 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:35.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一步步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:40.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從走錯的道路上糾正過來 奧布也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:46.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在事出有因離開了國家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:48.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為烏茲米 納拉 阿斯哈的後代
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:53.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,身為奧布聯合首長國首相這點沒有改變
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以此名下命令
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍不允許違背其理念
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:01.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻停止這場戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:03.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤兵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:16.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.32,0:07:21.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉 羅馬 賽蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:24.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:28.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 這是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:30.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:32.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是貴國的首相嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:33.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:37.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼事到如今才駕駛那種東西出現
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:39.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要求撤軍呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.18,0:07:43.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在如果不給個明確的表示
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:47.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,包括貴國在內 會有很多麻煩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:52.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是 不 所以說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:08.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種東西我不認識
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉大人 您說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:20.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是Strike Rouge
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.17,0:08:23.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個紋章也是卡嘉莉小姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:28.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算這樣 坐在裡面的也不一定是卡嘉莉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:30.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰能知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:32.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是剛才的聲音…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:35.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:41.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白 我明白 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:43.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:47.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然就是被人操縱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:57.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的卡嘉莉不會做這種讓我蒙羞的傻事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:08:57.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:08:59.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:02.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼 快開火 蠢貨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.15,0:09:06.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊那艘瘟神的船
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.99,0:09:08.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,準備開火
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.03,0:09:10.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:14.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我們會被地球軍攻擊 國家也會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:18.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是為了奧布這樣做的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:21.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今能隨便停止攻擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:26.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.91,0:09:28.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給我等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦現在最為不利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:35.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.04,0:09:39.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布不會真的這樣撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:44.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 有動靜了我們也出動 好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:46.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:49.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈瞄準 未知MS
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.10,0:09:51.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特達戛上校
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:54.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊迷惑我們的賊軍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快開火
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:03.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:30.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍 幹什麼 我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:56.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 雖然有亂入者攪局
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:59.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好情況仍對我方有利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.15,0:11:02.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要給重傷的Minerva劃上句點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:06.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等好久了 包在我們身上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:13.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑟 迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.63,0:11:14.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:17.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳 讓MS全體出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:18.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.86,0:11:22.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:30.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 休想得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:42.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海涅 維斯汀夫盧斯  GOUF出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:50.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 霍克  Zaku出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:53.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路  Zaku出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:07.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:09.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也趕快攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:12.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS隊 快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:14.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…但是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:18.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去打Minerva 不然又要被訓了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.19,0:12:20.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.95,0:12:26.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 那艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:28.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel也要打
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:29.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.11,0:12:33.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說到底那個不就是擾亂我國的根源嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:36.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,每次每次每次每次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:39.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要一起收拾掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:44.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不露兩手給那個假面男看可不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:13:00.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今天一定要打下你 混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:02.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:06.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍 MS各隊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:09.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和地球軍一同再次展開對Minerva的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:12.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是卡嘉莉小姐 那不是卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:14.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是卡嘉莉小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:15.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,假貨？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:19.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:32.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍 聽不到我的聲音嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.23,0:13:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不明白我的話嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:38.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍 停止戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:47.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:52.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很遺憾 看來已經毫無辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:53.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:57.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧 之後我盡力而為
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:00.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,9點方向 導彈8
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:38.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避 左舵10
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.19,0:14:48.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tristan 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:52.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,倉光號 岩迫號上前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:54.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩艘一起衝上去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:02.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避 下舵15
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.66,0:15:03.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,降下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:23.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴爾特菲路特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:25.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉和Archangel就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:27.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:31.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我可沒基拉那麼強啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:35.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠你們掩護了 拉米亞斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:36.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.09,0:15:40.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Murasame出擊後 本艦駛向Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:42.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,牽制奧布和地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:43.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:58.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和Zaku可不一樣啊 和Zaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:21.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:43.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然被壓制住了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:45.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進路無阻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:47.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴爾特菲路特隊長  Murasame出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:49.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:53.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,安特留 巴爾菲路特  Murasame出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.75,0:17:06.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下不了手就退下 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:11.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是在這裡被擊墜了 奧布怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:31.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不侵犯他國
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不容許他國入侵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:36.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不介入他國紛爭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.25,0:17:39.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們奧布以此為理念
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使時代變遷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.48,0:17:46.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也將堅守貫徹之
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:51.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這正是我們以國家為手段的生活之中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:56.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最基本最重要的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.94,0:17:58.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使在現在的形勢之下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:01.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也堅信這是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:04.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若屈服於地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.61,0:18:08.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許是能避免以武力行事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:13.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那是對最重要的奧布精神
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:18.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是對身為人的精神的侵略的縱容吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:24.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不確定陣營 地球軍就會攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:29.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我們還是不能屈服於此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.79,0:18:33.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若在此屈服 終有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:40.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們將變成只能遵從其指示命令而與敵作戰的國家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:44.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不允許侵略 這是奧布的理念
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.98,0:18:48.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為守護這理念 我們將堅持到最後一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:52.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然而 很遺憾危機已近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.36,0:18:54.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說了我沒基拉那麼強
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:01.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會被擊墜的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:12.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva右舷 MS 4
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.43,0:19:14.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能瞄準中間嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.67,0:19:15.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:17.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別打中機體
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:19.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried 2號 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.11,0:19:23.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:24.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘船…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一開始還打壞我們的主炮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:29.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:40.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該不是真打算做阻止戰爭這種蠢事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.63,0:19:42.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:45.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:46.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:49.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:08.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊 那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.63,0:20:11.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:15.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左舷前方 克勞米伽比級
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.47,0:20:16.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拖住那艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:18.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Valient 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:28.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:30.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是幫哪邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:35.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.97,0:20:37.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.65,0:20:51.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:54.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見人就砍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:57.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳 別太得意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.06,0:21:02.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.55,0:21:08.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:11.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢對我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:21.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別礙事！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.85,0:21:34.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海涅！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.97,0:21:59.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海涅…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.19,0:22:05.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,涙で滲んだ  この時空を  見上げるたび
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚い蒼さが  胸を締めつけてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命なら  哀しみの果てまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戦い続けた  日々を跡に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　燃え上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真実の自分さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見失いそう　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心は砕かれて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本当の哀しみを知った瞳は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛に溢れて....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:25.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有信念 只有力量都不行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:27.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深知此事的心彼此都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.83,0:23:30.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道是什麼產生了隔閡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.15,0:23:33.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人們不知不覺間 踏上了不同的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:40.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而時光流逝中 現在真與雷所看到的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.34,0:23:44.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下回 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:46.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交錯的視線
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.94,0:23:49.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,飛向狂風巨浪的海洋吧 Saviour
